ocks":["b-13-3"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"1．考查栈和队列的特点及应用。C 和D 直接排除，缓冲区的特点需要先进先出，若用栈，则先进入缓冲区的数据则要排队到最后才能打印，不符题意，所以只有队列符合题意。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-2-2","number":"2","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-4","b-13-5","b-13-6"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"2．考查栈的最大递归深度。时刻注意栈的特点是先进后出。下面是出入栈的详细过程：","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-3-2","number":"3","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-7"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"3．考查二叉树的特殊遍历。分析遍历后的结点序列，可以看出根结点是在中间被访问的，而且右子树结点在左子树之前，则遍历的方法是RNL。本题考查的遍历方法并不是二叉树遍历的三种基本遍历方法，对于考生而言，重要的是要掌握遍历的思想。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-4-2","number":"4","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-8"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"4．考查平衡二叉树的定义。根据平衡二叉树的定义有，任意结点的左右子树高度差的绝对值不超过1。而其余三个答案均可以找到不符合的结点。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-5-2","number":"5","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-9"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"5．考查完全二叉树的特点。完全二叉树比起满二叉树只是在最下面一层的右边缺少了部分叶结点，而最后一层之上是个满二叉树，并且只有最后两层上有叶结点。第6 层有叶结点则完全二叉树的高度可能为6 或7，显然树高为7时结点更多。若第6 层上有8 个叶结点，则前六层为满二叉树，而第7 层缺失了 \\(\\displaystyle 8\\times2=16\\) 个叶结点，故完全二叉树的结点个数最多为 \\(\\displaystyle 2^7-1-16=111\\) 个结点。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-6-2","number":"6","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-10"],"sourcePages":["13"],"stem":"6．考查森林和二叉树的转换。森林与二叉树的转换规则为“左孩子右兄弟”。在最后生成的二叉树中，父子关系在对应森林关系中可能是兄弟关系或原本就是父子关系。情形Ⅰ：若结点v 是结点u 的第二个孩子结点，在转换时，结点v 就变成结点u 第一个孩子的右孩子，符合要求。情形Ⅱ：结点u 和v 是兄弟结点的关系，但二者之中还有一个兄弟结点k，则转换后，结点v 就变为结点k 的右孩子，而结点k 则是结点u 的右孩子，符合要求。情形Ⅲ：结点v 的父结点要么是原先的父结点或兄弟结点。若结点u 的父结点与v 的父结点是兄弟关系，则转换之后，不可能出现结点u 是结点v 的父结点的父结点。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-7-2","number":"7","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-13-11","b-14-1"],"sourcePages":["13","14"],"stem":"7．考查无向连通图的特性。每条边都连接了两个结点，则在计算顶点的度之时，这条边都被计算了两次，故所有顶点的度之和","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-8-2","number":"8","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-2"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"8．考查m 阶B-树的定义。A、B 和C 都是B-树的特点，而选项D 则是B+树的特点。注意区别B-树和B+树各自的特点。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-9-3","number":"9","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-3","b-14-4"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"9．考查小根堆的调整操作。小顶堆在逻辑上可以用完全二叉树来表示，根据关键序列得到的小顶堆的二叉树形式为下图左图：插入关键字3 时，先将其放在小顶堆的末端，再将该关键字向上进行调整，得到的结果上图右边所示。所以，调整后的小顶堆序列为：3，5，12，8，28，20，15，22，19。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-10-2","number":"10","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-5"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"10．考查各排序算法的特点。解答本题之前要对不同排序算法的特点极为清楚。对于起泡排序和选择排序而言，每一趟过后都能确定一个元素的最终位置，而由题目中所说，前两个元素和后两个元素均不是最小或最大的两个元素并按序排列。答案D 中的二路归并排序，第一趟排序结束都可以得到若干个有序子序列，而此时的序列中并没有两两元素有序排列。插入排序在每趟排序结束后能保证前面的若干元素是有序的，而此时第二趟排序后，序列的前三个元素是有序的，符合其特点。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-11-2","number":"11","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-6"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"11．考查指令执行过程。通常完成一条指令可分为取指阶段和执行阶段。在取指阶段通过访问存储器可将指令取出；在执行阶段通过访问存储器可以将操作数取出。这样，虽然指令和数据都是以二进制代码形式存放在存储器中，但CPU 可以判断在取指阶段访问存储器取出的二进制代码是指令；在执行阶段访存取出的二进制代码是数据。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-12-2","number":"12","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-7"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"12．考查符号位的扩展。结合题干及选项可知，int 为32 位，short 为16 位；又C 语言的数据在内存中为补码形式，故x、y的机器数写为0000007FH、FFF7H;执行z=x+y 时，由于x 是int 型，y 为short 型，故需将y 的类型强制转换为int，在机器中通过符号位扩展实现，由于y 的符号位为1，故在y 的前面添加16 个1，即可将y 强制转换为int 型，其十六进制形式为FFFFFFF7H;然后执行加法，即0000007FH+FFFFFFF7H=00000076H，其中最高位的进位1 自然丢弃。故选D。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-13-2","number":"13","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-8"],"sourcePages":["14"],"stem":"13．考查浮点加法运算。根据题意，X可记为00, 111; 00, 11101（分号前为阶码，分号后为尾数），Y可记为00, 101; 00, 10100。首先对阶，X、Y 阶码相减，即00, 111-00, 101=00, 111+11, 0111=00, 010，可知X 的阶码比Y 的价码大2，根据小阶向大阶看齐的原则，将Y 的阶码加2，尾数右移2 位，可得Y 为00, 111; 00, 00101。尾数相加，即00, 11101+00, 00101=01, 00010，尾数相加结果符号位为01，故需进行右规。规格化，将尾数右移1 位，阶码加1，得X+Y 为01, 000; 00, 1000，阶码符号位为01，说明发生溢出。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-14-2","number":"14","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-14-9","b-15-1"],"sourcePages":["14","15"],"stem":"14．考查Cache 与主存之间的映射方式。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-15-2","number":"15","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-2"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"15．考查存储器的扩展。首先确定 ROM 的个数，ROM 区为 4KB，选用 \\(\\displaystyle 2K\\times8\\) 的 ROM 芯片，需要 \\(\\displaystyle \\dfrac{\\displaystyle 4K\\times8}{\\displaystyle 2K\\times8}=2\\) 片，采用字扩展方式；60KB 的 RAM 区，选用 \\(\\displaystyle 4K\\times4\\) 的 RAM 芯片，需要 \\(\\displaystyle \\dfrac{\\displaystyle 60K\\times8}{\\displaystyle 4K\\times4}=30\\) 片，采用字和位同时扩展方式。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-16-2","number":"16","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-3"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"16．考查相对寻址。相对寻址EA=(PC)+A，首先要求的是取指令后PC 的值。转移指令由两个字节组成，每取一个字节PC 自动加1，因此取指令后PC 值为2002H，故EA=(PC)+A=2002H+06H=2008H。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-17-3","number":"17","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-4"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"17．考查RISC 的特性。相对于CISC 计算机，RISC 计算机的特点指令条数少；指令长度固定，指令格式和寻址种类少；只有取数/存数指令访问存储器，其余指令的操作均在寄存器之间进行；CPU 中通用寄存器多；大部分指令在一个或者小于一个机器周期内完成；以硬布线逻辑为主，不用或者少用微程序控制。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-18-2","number":"18","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-5"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"18．考查流水线中时钟周期的特性。时钟周期应以最长的执行时间为准，否则用时长的流水段的功能将不能正确完成。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-19-2","number":"19","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-6"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"19．考查硬布线控制器的特点。硬布线控制器的速度取决于电路延迟，所以速度快；微程序控制器采用了存储程序原理，每条指令都要访控存，所以速度慢。硬布线控制器采用专门的逻辑电路实现，修改和扩展困难。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-20-2","number":"20","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-7"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"20．考查总线的基本概念。总线带宽是指单位时间内总线上可传输数据的位数，通常用每秒钟传送信息的字节数来衡量，单位可用字节/秒（Bps）表示。根据题意可知，在 \\(\\displaystyle 2\\times1/10\\text{MHz}\\) 秒内传输了4B，所以 \\(\\displaystyle 4\\text{B}\\times10\\text{MHz}/2=20\\text{MB/s}\\) 。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-21-2","number":"21","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-8"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"21．考查Cache 的命中率。命中率=Cache 命中的次数/所有访问次数，有了这个公式这道题就很容易看出，要注意的一点是看清题，题中说明的是缺失50次，而不是命中50次，仔细审题是做对题的第一步。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-22-2","number":"22","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-9"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"22．考查中断的分类。选项中能引起外部中断的只能是输入设备键盘。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-23-2","number":"23","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-10"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"23．考查并行性的限定。单处理机系统中只有一条指令流水线，一个多功能的操作部件，每个时钟周期只能完成一条指令，故进程与进程显然不可以并行。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-24-2","number":"24","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-11"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"24．考查几种基本的调度算法概念。高响应比优先调度算法，同时考虑每个进程的等待时间和需要的执行时间，从中选出响应比最高的进程投入执行。响应比R定义如下：响应比 \\(\\displaystyle R=\\dfrac{\\displaystyle \\text{等待时间}+\\text{执行时间}}{\\displaystyle \\text{执行时间}}\\)","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-25-3","number":"25","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-15-12"],"sourcePages":["15"],"stem":"25．考查死锁的条件。这种题用到组合数学中鸽巢原理的思想，考虑最极端情况，因为每个进程最多需要3 台打印机，如果每个进程已经占有了两个打印机，那么只要还有多的打印机，那么总能满足达到3 台的条件，所以，将8 台打印机分给K 个进程，每个进程有2 台打印机，这个情况就是极端情况，K 为4。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-26-2","number":"26","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-1"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"26．考查分区分配存储管理方式的保护措施。分区分配存储管理方式的保护措施是设置界地址寄存器。每个进程都有自己独立的进程空间，如果一个进程在运行时所产生的地址在其地址空间之外，则发生地址越界，即当程序要访问某个内存单元时，由硬件检查是否允许，如果允许则执行，否则产生地址越界中断,由操作系统进行相应处理。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-27-2","number":"27","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-2"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"27．考查分段存储管理系统。段地址为32 位二进制数，其中8 位表示段号，则段内位移占用32-8=24 位二进制数，故最大段长为 \\(\\displaystyle 2^{24}\\) 字节。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-28-2","number":"28","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-3"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"28．考查文件物理结构的特性。随机访问是索引结构的特性。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-29-2","number":"29","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-4"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"29．考查磁盘的调度算法。类似于电梯调度的思想。首先，磁头选择与当前磁头所在磁道距离最近的请求作为首次服务的对象（110），当磁头沿途相应访问请求序列直到达到一端末（110,170,180,195），再反向移动响应另一端的访问请求（68,45,35,12）。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-30-2","number":"30","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-5"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"30．考查文件控制块的内容。在文件控制块中，通常含有以下3 类信息，即基本信息、存取控制信息及使用信息。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-31-2","number":"31","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-6"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"31．考查软/硬链接建立的属性。建立符号链接（软链接）时，引用计数值直接复制；建立硬链接时，引用计数值加1。删除文件时，删除操作对于符号链接是不可见的，这并不影响文件系统，当以后再通过符号链接访问时，发现文件不存在，直接删除符号链接；但是对于硬链接则不可以直接删除，引用计数值减1，若值不为0，则不能删除此文件，因为还有其它硬链接指向此文件。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-32-2","number":"32","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-7"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"32．考查系统调用的设备标识。用户程序对I/O 设备的请求采用逻辑设备名，而在程序实际执行时使用物理设备名。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-33-3","number":"33","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-8"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"33．考查OSI 模型中传输层的功能。传输层提供应用进程间的逻辑通信，即端到端的通信。而网络层提供点到点的逻辑通信。因此选B。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-34-2","number":"34","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-9"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"34．考查奈氏准则和香农定理。采用4 个相位，每个相位有4 种幅度的QAM 调制方法，每个信号可以有16 种变化，传输4bit 的数据。根据奈奎斯特定理，信息的最大传输速率为 \\(\\displaystyle 2\\times3K\\times4=24\\text{Kbps}\\) 。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-35-2","number":"35","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-10"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"35．考查后退N 帧协议的工作原理。在后退N 帧协议中，发送方可以连续发送若干个数据帧，如果收到接收方的确认帧则可以继续发送。若某个帧出错，接收方只是简单的丢弃该帧及其后所有的后续帧，发送方超时后需重传该数据帧及其后续的所有数据帧。这里要注意，连续ARQ 协议中，接收方一般采用累积确认的方式，即接收方对按序到达的最后一个分组发送确认，因此题目中收到3 的确认帧就代表编号为0、1、2、3 的帧已接收，而此时发送方未收到1 号帧的确认只能代表确认帧在返回的过程中丢失了，而不代表1 号帧未到达接收方。因此需要重传的帧为编号是4、5、6、7 的帧。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-36-2","number":"36","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-11"],"sourcePages":["16"],"stem":"36．考查交换机的工作原理。交换机实质上是一个多端口网桥，工作在数据链路层，数据链路层使用物理地址进行转发，而转发通常都是根据目的地址来决定出端口。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-37-2","number":"37","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-16-12","b-17-1"],"sourcePages":["16","17"],"stem":"37．考查CSMA/CD 协议的工作原理。首先由例8 可知，若最短帧长减少，而数据传输速率不变，则需要使冲突域的最大距离变短来实现争用期的减少。争用期是指网络中收发结点间的往返时延，因此假设需要减少的最小距离为s，单位是m，则可以得到下式（注意单位的转换）： \\(\\displaystyle 2\\times\\dfrac{\\displaystyle s}{\\displaystyle 2\\times10^8}=\\dfrac{\\displaystyle 800}{\\displaystyle 1\\times10^9}\\) ，因此可得s=80，即最远的两个站点","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-38-2","number":"38","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-17-2"],"sourcePages":["17"],"stem":"38．考查TCP 的数据编号与确认。TCP 是面向字节流的，其选择确认（Selective ACK）机制是接收端对字节序号进行确认，其返回的序号是接收端下一次期望接收的序号，因此主机乙接收两个段后返回给主机甲的确认序列号是1000。","options":[],"answer":{"value":null,"solution":null,"explanation":null,"commentary":null,"knowledge":null,"sourceDocumentId":null,"sourceQuestionIds":[],"sourceBlocks":[],"sourcePages":[],"status":"missing"},"status":"complete","context":null,"questionType":"answer"},{"id":"q-39-2","number":"39","sectionKind":"single_choice","sectionTitle":"一、单项选择题","recordType":"answer","sourceBlocks":["b-17-3"],"sourcePages":["17"],"stem":"39．考查TCP 的拥塞控制方法。本题计算原理如图4 所示。无论在慢开始阶段还是在拥塞避免阶段，只要发送方判断网络出现拥塞（其根据就是没有按时收到确认），就要把慢开始门限ssthresh 设置为出现拥塞时的发送方窗口值的一半（但不能小于2）。然后把拥塞窗口cwnd 重新设置为1，执行慢开始算法。这样做的目的就是要迅速减少主机发送到网络中的分组数，使得发生拥塞的路由器有足够时间把队列中积压的分组处理完毕。因此，在发送拥塞后，慢开始门限ssthresh 变为16/2 = 8 KB，发送窗口变为1 KB。在接下来的3个RTT 内，拥塞窗口执行慢开始算法，呈指数形式增加到8 KB，此时由于慢开始门限ssthresh 为8 KB，因此转而执行拥塞避免算法，即拥塞窗口开始“加法增大”。因此第4 个RTT 结